<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείρων-αξ</span></b>  (properisp.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ακτος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who is master of his hands</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄναξ τῶν χειρῶν</span>), i.e.
				<i>handicraftsman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Art.</u>
				53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				6.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.802a
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> as
				Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶς ὁ χ. λεώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					844
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>one who handles, deals in</i> a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶνδε χειρώνακτες . . λόγων,</span> i.e.  soothsayers, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				795.3
			</span></i>.</div>
